<h2>Emacs side of things</h2>
<div class="highlight"><pre><span></span><code>package-install RET envrc
</code></pre></div>

<h2>In your project</h2>
<p>This is what I used for Python based projects. I use <code>pipenv</code> and
<code>Pipfiles</code>. Thus, I need to set <code>VIRTUAL_ENV</code> to make everything work.</p>
<div class="highlight"><pre><span></span><code>$ cd ~/src/awesome-app
$ direnv allow
</code></pre></div>

<p>Find where the virtual environemnt <em>actualy</em> resides:</p>
<div class="highlight"><pre><span></span><code>$ pipenv run which python3 | sed &#39;s#/bin/python3$##&#39;
/home/torstein/.local/share/virtualenvs/awesome-app-EpEGAS3U
</code></pre></div>

<p>Add this to an <code>.envrc</code> in your project root:</p>
<div class="highlight"><pre><span></span><code>$ vim .envrc
</code></pre></div>

<div class="highlight"><pre><span></span><code><span class="k">export</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="n">VIRTUAL_ENV</span><span class="o">=/</span><span class="n">home</span><span class="o">/</span><span class="n">torstein</span><span class="o">/.</span><span class="n">local</span><span class="o">/</span><span class="n">share</span><span class="o">/</span><span class="n">virtualenvs</span><span class="o">/</span><span class="n">awesome</span><span class="o">-</span><span class="n">app</span><span class="o">-</span><span class="n">EpEGAS3U</span>
<span class="k">export</span><span class="w"> </span><span class="n">PATH</span><span class="o">=$</span><span class="p">{</span><span class="n">VIRTUAL_ENV</span><span class="p">}</span><span class="o">/</span><span class="n">bin</span><span class="p">:</span><span class="o">$</span><span class="n">PATH</span>
</code></pre></div>